  "description_en": "Retrieves the description and metadata of an integration source table, including the table description and field list. This operation supports three sources: project or compute source tables, direct query tables of data sources, and externally collected data sources. The query results are returned in real time. For external data sources, metadata collection must be completed first. Release version: v6.3.2",
